<% content_for :title, "JACKPOT" %>
<% top = Dopamine.top_rarity %>
<div class="fixed inset-0 z-40 overflow-hidden bg-[#141416] text-white" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="ジャックポット">
  <%= sfx_cue("fanfare") %>
  <div class="confetti" aria-hidden="true"><% 12.times { |i| %><span style="--i: <%= i %>"></span><% } %></div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto flex h-full w-full max-w-md flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 text-center">
    <p class="rounded-full border border-yellow-200/40 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-yellow-200"><%= rarity_percent(top) %>% の出目</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.3em] text-yellow-200/80">JACKPOT</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-5xl font-black tracking-wider text-[#FFD166]"><%= card_name(top[:name]) %></p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-300">この記事を読み切ると、金の枠のカードが図鑑に残る</p>

    <div class="mt-6 w-full rounded-2xl bg-white/10 p-4 text-left">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300"><%= @article.feed.title %></p>
      <h1 class="mt-1 text-base font-bold leading-snug"><%= @article.title %></h1>
    </div>

    <%= link_to "読んで手に入れる", read_article_path(@article), class: "mt-6 flex h-12 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#FFD166] text-base font-bold text-gray-900 active:bg-yellow-300" %>
    <p class="mt-4 text-balance text-xs text-gray-400">全画面演出は読み始めるまで閉じられない。頻度が低いから効く</p>
  </div>
</div>
